  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Infrastructure Decoupling: Successfully migrated Environment IO, Unix Directory Permissions, and Configuration Loading logic from the main framework to Nalix.Environment.\n- Secure Bootstrapping: Hardened filesystem sanitization and directory preparation helpers for cross-platform reliability.\n- Performance Configuration: Optimized ConfigurationLoader and Binding systems to support zero-allocation POCO options.\n- Clean Dependency Flow: Established a lean foundation that serves as the primary configuration provider for Nalix.Engine and Nalix.Framework.",
